WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.845
The core motivation is trust.

00:00:03.925 --> 00:00:07.771
If you cannot prove a policy is robust,

00:00:07.851 --> 00:00:11.696
then passing today's attacks tells you little about
tomorrow's.

00:00:11.776 --> 00:00:15.622
Randomized smoothing has become a leading tool for
certifying image classifiers,

00:00:15.702 --> 00:00:19.547
but reinforcement learning does not fit its mold.

00:00:19.627 --> 00:00:23.473
In classification the confidence output lives in a
known zero-to-one range and behaves like a probability;

00:00:23.553 --> 00:00:27.398
in Q-learning the value function has an unknown
range and its outputs are not probabilities at all.

00:00:27.478 --> 00:00:31.324
On top of that,

00:00:31.404 --> 00:00:35.249
a single action decision is not the whole story:
what ultimately matters is the reward

00:00:35.329 --> 00:00:39.175
accumulated along an entire trajectory of decisions.

00:00:39.255 --> 00:00:43.100
CROP is designed to overcome both obstacles.
